  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      119.04,
      392.04,
      284.04,
      433.52
    ],
    "text": "Notice under Section 7 Reference No.: 4/3/9/2013/WS/473.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613,
      16.078292846679688
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.64,
      435.41,
      289.8,
      513.91
    ],
    "text": "I, hereby give notice under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 of the Land Acquisition Act, as Amended by the land Acquisition (Amendment) Act, No. 28 of 1964, that the Government intends to acquire the following land/servitude which is required for a public purpose.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613,
      11.998800277709961
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.64,
      514.87,
      286.45,
      614.72
    ],
    "text": "Description of the land or servitude to be acquired: The lands called Mahawatta, in extent of 0.1010 Hectares stated in Lot No. 372 depicted in the F.V.P. 33 Supplementary 18, prepared by the Surveyor-General, situated in the village of Moragaspitiya of Udugoda Udasiyapattuwa Minor Division in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Pallepola in Matale District of Central Province, as bounded as followed.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.91920804977417,
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.64,
      616.64,
      286.44,
      663.43
    ],
    "text": "What is the Public Purpose: Construction of a Walmoruwa Water Tank for the Huge Matale Water Supply Project.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.08,
      361.76,
      539.38,
      401.84
    ],
    "text": "Name of the Land: Mahawatta; Claiment: Mr. Konara Mudiyanselage Wijerathna Banda, No. 09, Kongahamula, Palapathwala.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.08,
      402.07,
      539.4,
      434.96
    ],
    "text": "North: Lot No. 336 2/2 and Homapola (F.V.P. 42); East: Homapola (F.V.P. 42) and Lot No. 6; South: Lot No. 336 2/2 and 6; West: Lot No. 6 and 336 2/2.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.08,
      436.4,
      539.42,
      675.43
    ],
    "text": "All persons interested in the aforesaid lands are hereby required to appear personally, or by agents duly authorized in writing before me at Divisional Secretariat of Pallepola on the 21st day of June 2017 At 10.00 a.m. and are hereby requested to notify me in writing (in duplicated) on or before the 19th day of May, 2017 the nature of their interests in the land, the particulars of their claims for compensation for the acquisition of the said land, the amount of compensation and the details of the computation of such amount. W. M. ANANDA, Divisional Secretary, Pallepola Division. Divisional Secretary\u2019s Office, Pallepola, 20th March, 2017. 06 - 05",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      6.959303855895996,
      7.91920804977417,
      10.078991889953613,
      11.998800277709961
    ]
  },
